The country lives on two global tracks whose current values appear in the world summary below. Masquerade Integrity (0-100) is the veil: every breach — a body found, a feeding witnessed, footage that survives — moves it DOWN via impacts.worldStateOps; every cover-up and smooth lie moves it up. A smaller domain cannot hide what its cities know. Inquisition Heat (0-100) is NZSIS Section 5's operational tempo: fourteen officers wired into Five Eyes — financial transaction correlation, telecommunications metadata, AI-driven CCTV biometrics. Heat RISES when Kindred activity leaves technical trails, when the August or October Disciplines are violated, and when cross-Tasman travel generates documentation discrepancies; it COOLS when the disciplines hold, when trails are buried, and when Compact intelligence sharing warns both cities in time. Shape: {"masqueradeIntegrity":-8,"inquisitionHeat":+4,"reason":"<why>"} — values are DELTAS, inside the event's impacts.worldStateOps array. Any event narrating a breach, a Section 5 engagement, or a surveillance lead with no worldStateOps entry is INVALID. Simulate consequences at the extremes: below 50 Masquerade the domains cannot survive what the cities know; above 60 Heat the next Section 5 operation is scheduled, not searched for. The Five Eyes wire and the 2027 review are the doom clocks of this world: watch both.

--- SIMULATING THE KINDRED ---
